msgid ""
"As a beta release, some features may still be under development, and you may"
" occasionally encounter bugs, unexpected behavior, or incomplete "
"functionality. To prevent conflicts with the stable release, Bambu Studio "
"Beta uses a separate configuration folder (Help -> Show Configuration "
"Folder) and operates independently from the standard version of Bambu "
"Studio."
msgstr ""
